Index: SDD

Purpose:
  The primary entry point of the .sdd system. The agent must route all
  other .sdd data through this file. No file is self-contained — all
  files obey the INDEX → PROTOCOL → RESOLVER → CONTEXT mechanism.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
    1  @protocol/ROOT.sdd
    2  @project/project.sdd
    3  @graph/graph.sdd
    4  @templates/INDEX.sdd (project structure templates)
    5  @project/graph/ (domain-level graphs, when present)
